Q1:- 1. Pet Adoption App
○ Design classes for Pet, Dog, Cat, and Bird. Use inheritance and constructors
to initialize them.

Start
Define 
Class Pet
ATTRIBUTES: name, age, color
CONSTRUCTOR(name, age, color)
SET this.name=name
SET this.age=age
SET this.color=color
METHOD display()
PRINT name, age, color

CLASS Dog EXTENDS Pet
ATTRIBUTE: breed
CONSTRUCTOR: (name, age, color, breed)
CALL super(name, age, color)
SET this.breed = breed
MAETHOD display()
CALL super.display()
PRINT breed

CLASS Cat EXTENDS Pet
    ATTRIBUTE: isIndoor
    CONSTRUCTOR(name, age, color, isIndoor)
        CALL super(name, age, color)
        SET this.isIndoor = isIndoor
    METHOD display()
        CALL super.display()
        PRINT "Indoor Cat: Yes" IF isIndoor ELSE "Indoor Cat: No"
